
<!--
  HOW TO USE THIS FILE:

  <Award
    name - the name of the achievement / trophy, for debugging purposes
    index - the platform index of the achievement / trophy to be awarded
    uplay - optional, the uplay action index to be awarded

  Conditions:
  An award must have 1 or more conditions. When all of the conditions are met the achievement / trophy
  will be awarded. Conditions must be based upon / contain 1 or more statistics. 
  There are 3 types of conditions:
  <Cumulative
    count - The condition is met when all the statistics added together reach or exceed this value.
  <MultiAnd
    Must have 2 or more statistics. Each stat has a count value. The condition is met when ALL the stats reach or exceed their specified values.
  <MultiOr
    Must have 2 or more statistics. Each stat has a count value. The condition is met when ANY of the stats reach or exceed their specified value.

  Statistics:
  There are 4 types of statistic:
  <Stat> and <InvStat> are based upon values found in the "stats": section of the file: \\main\data\engine\settings\TrackingConfig.json
  <Stat
    name - the name of the statistic, follows "name": in the aformentioned file
    count - optional, used with the <MultiAnd> <MultiOr> conditions to suply target values for multiple statistics.
  <InvStat> - usage is the same as for <Stat> except that this value will return the inverse. Use only for <Cumulative> condition to perform a subtraction of one stat from another
-->

